@startuml
title Weather Station System States

[*] --> Running
state "Running" as Running
state "Shutdown" as Shutdown

Running --> ConfigMode : Changes/Power-saving settings
ConfigMode --> Running : Configuration completed
Running --> CollectData : Triggered by clock
CollectData --> Running : Data collected
Running --> Summary : Request for weather summary
Summary --> Running : Weather summary prepared
Running --> StatusCheck : Request for status check
StatusCheck --> Running : Status checked
Running --> ControlledMode : Remote control
Running --> Shutdown : Shutdown command given

[*] --> InitialComponent : Load Component (for orphan state)
InitialComponent --> WaitingForUpdate : Detect update
WaitingForUpdate --> ProcessUpdate : Update processed
ProcessUpdate --> UnloadingPhase : Failure/Shutdown

title Equihealth States

state J1 <<choice>>
[*] --> INITIAL_COMPONENT : Load Component (for orphan state)
InitialComponent --> J1 : [check user]
state "J1" as J1
state J2 : Patient
state J3 : Health Worker
state J4 : Government Official
J1 --> J2 : Patient
J1 --> J3 : Health Worker
J1 --> J4 : Government Official

J2 --> ProvideMedicalInfo : Sign in as patient
ProvideMedicalInfo --> J2 : Medical information provided
ProvideMedicalInfo --> J3 : Analysis performed

J3 --> PrepareAlerts : Based on analyzed information
PrepareAlerts --> J3 : Alerts prepared
PrepareAlerts --> J4 : Alerts sent to appropriate operators

title National Health Id States

state Choice1 <<choice>>
[*] --> InitialComponent : Load Component (for orphan state)
InitialComponent --> Choice1 : (Indian citizen or Not Indian citizen)
state "Choice1" as Choice1
state Choice2 : Verification
state Choice3 : Activation
Choice1 --> Choice2 : [Indian citizen]
Choice1 --> Running : [Not Indian citizen]
Choice2 --> Verification : entry
Verification --> VerifiedStatus : Details verified
Verification --> NotVerified : Details not verified

Choice1 --> [*] : Not Initial transition
Choice3 --> SetPermissions : After activation
SetPermissions --> AddOldFiles : Allow users to add old files
AddOldFiles --> StoreOldFiles : Old files stored
AddOldFiles --> AccessGranted : Permission granted for access
AccessGranted --> AddNewFiles : Allow adding new files when permission is granted
@enduml
